{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ915bCBUPSL5hcaqvLA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018N1VBveKkWxVNV7hp6Nhne","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-015-n5xhGM/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>API 按量计费价格</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <header class=\"hero\">\n      <span class=\"badge\">按量计费 · 无月费 · 无最低消费</span>\n      <h1>API 服务价格</h1>\n      <p>只为实际调用付费。每个接口每月都有免费额度，超出部分按每千次调用计费，按月结算。</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"highlights\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">起步价格</div><div class=\"value\">¥0.50 / 千次</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">每月免费调用</div><div class=\"value free\">最高 10 万次</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">计费粒度</div><div class=\"value\">按次累计</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">结算周期</div><div class=\"value\">自然月</div></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <h2>接口价格表</h2>\n    <div class=\"table-scroll\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>接口</th>\n            <th>说明</th>\n            <th>每月免费额度</th>\n            <th>超出后单价（每千次）</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody id=\"price-body\"></tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2>阶梯折扣</h2>\n    <div class=\"tiers\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><h3>0 – 100 万次</h3><div class=\"value\">标准价</div><p>超出免费额度后按价格表计费</p></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><h3>100 万 – 1000 万次</h3><div class=\"value\">9 折</div><p>当月该接口超出部分自动享受</p></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><h3>1000 万次以上</h3><div class=\"value\">8 折</div><p>更大用量可联系销售定制价格</p></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2>费用估算</h2>\n    <div class=\"card calc\">\n      <div class=\"calc-row\">\n        <label>接口\n          <select id=\"calc-api\"></select>\n        </label>\n        <label>每月调用次数\n          <input id=\"calc-calls\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1000\" value=\"500000\">\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"calc-result\">\n        <div class=\"total\" id=\"calc-total\">¥0.00</div>\n        <div class=\"detail\" id=\"calc-detail\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2>计费说明</h2>\n    <ul class=\"notes\">\n      <li>免费额度按接口分别计算，每月 1 日 00:00（UTC+8）重置，未用完的额度不累计到下月。</li>\n      <li>仅成功返回（HTTP 2xx）的请求计入调用次数；4xx、5xx 及限流请求不计费。</li>\n      <li>不足一千次的部分按实际次数折算，费用精确到分。</li>\n      <li>阶梯折扣按单个接口当月累计调用量计算，与免费额度叠加使用。</li>\n      <li>以上价格均为人民币含税价，如有调整将提前 30 天通知。</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <footer>如需企业套餐、私有化部署或 SLA 保障，请联系销售团队。</footer>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    const APIS = [\n      { name: \"文本识别 OCR\",   endpoint: \"POST /v1/ocr\",        desc: \"图片文字识别，支持中英文混排\", free: 10000,  price: 1.50 },\n      { name: \"图像标签\",       endpoint: \"POST /v1/image/tags\", desc: \"识别图片中的物体与场景\",       free: 10000,  price: 2.00 },\n      { name: \"文本翻译\",       endpoint: \"POST /v1/translate\",  desc: \"支持 100+ 语种互译\",           free: 50000,  price: 0.80 },\n      { name: \"情感分析\",       endpoint: \"POST /v1/sentiment\",  desc: \"判断文本正负面情绪倾向\",       free: 100000, price: 0.50 },\n      { name: \"语音转文字\",     endpoint: \"POST /v1/asr\",        desc: \"单次音频不超过 60 秒\",         free: 5000,   price: 4.00 },\n      { name: \"短信验证码\",     endpoint: \"POST /v1/sms/verify\", desc: \"国内手机号验证码发送\",         free: 1000,   price: 45.00 },\n      { name: \"IP 地理位置\",    endpoint: \"GET /v1/geoip\",       desc: \"IP 地址查询国家/城市/运营商\",  free: 100000, price: 0.50 },\n    ];\n\n    const yuan = n => \"¥\" + n.toLocaleString(\"zh-CN\", { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 });\n    const count = n => n >= 10000 ? (n / 10000).toLocaleString(\"zh-CN\") + \" 万次\" : n.toLocaleString(\"zh-CN\") + \" 次\";\n\n    document.getElementById(\"price-body\").innerHTML = APIS.map(a => `\n      <tr>\n        <td><span class=\"api\">${a.name}</span><span class=\"endpoint\">${a.endpoint}</span></td>\n        <td>${a.desc}</td>\n        <td class=\"num\"><span class=\"quota\">${count(a.free)} / 月</span></td>\n        <td class=\"num\"><span class=\"price\">${yuan(a.price)}</span></td>\n      </tr>`).join(\"\");\n\n    const sel = document.getElementById(\"calc-api\");\n    sel.innerHTML = APIS.map((a, i) => `<option value=\"${i}\">${a.name}</option>`).join(\"\");\n    const input = document.getElementById(\"calc-calls\");\n\n    // 阶梯：超出免费额度后，按当月累计调用量所在区间打折\n    const TIERS = [\n      { upTo: 1_000_000,  rate: 1.0 },\n      { upTo: 10_000_000, rate: 0.9 },\n      { upTo: Infinity,   rate: 0.8 },\n    ];\n\n    function estimate() {\n      const a = APIS[sel.value];\n      const calls = Math.max(0, Math.floor(Number(input.value) || 0));\n      let cost = 0, prev = 0;\n      for (const t of TIERS) {\n        const lo = Math.max(prev, a.free);\n        const hi = Math.min(calls, t.upTo);\n        if (hi > lo) cost += (hi - lo) / 1000 * a.price * t.rate;\n        prev = t.upTo;\n      }\n      cost = Math.round(cost * 100) / 100;\n      const billable = Math.max(0, calls - a.free);\n      document.getElementById(\"calc-total\").textContent = yuan(cost) + \" / 月\";\n      document.getElementById(\"calc-detail\").textContent = billable === 0\n        ? `${count(calls)}在免费额度（${count(a.free)}）内，无需付费。`\n        : `免费 ${count(a.free)}，计费 ${count(billable)}，标准单价 ${yuan(a.price)} / 千次（已含阶梯折扣）。`;\n    }\n    sel.addEventListener(\"change\", estimate);\n    input.addEventListener(\"input\", estimate);\n    estimate();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2292,"cache_read_input_tokens":31725,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2292},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"s